945	// mcpGraphBinary resolves the Entire CLI binary that exposes `graph` provider
946	// commands from the trusted server environment, never from untrusted MCP client
947	// arguments. An operator can override it via ENTIRE_BRAIN_GRAPH_BINARY; otherwise
948	// it defaults to "entire". Resolving this server-side closes the
949	// arbitrary-executable vector that an untrusted (or prompt-injected) MCP client
950	// would otherwise reach through a tool argument.
951	func mcpGraphBinary() string {
